1. Filter Even Numbers
Input
[1,2,3,4,5,6]

Code
list.stream()
    .filter(n -> n % 2 == 0)
    .toList();

Output
[2,4,6]

2. Filter Odd Numbers
Input
[1,2,3,4,5,6]

Code
list.stream()
    .filter(n -> n % 2 != 0)
    .toList();

Output
[1,3,5]

