40. Row-wise Sum Of Two Lists
Input
List1=[1,2,5]

List2=[6,4,3]

Code
IntStream.range(0,list1.size())
         .mapToObj(i ->
            list1.get(i)+list2.get(i))
         .toList();

Output
[7,6,8]

